WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:10.400


00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.110
Pull over.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.070
At the intersection ahead,

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:19.270
just pull over there.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:20.920
Okay.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.090
Let me drive you inside.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:25.730
No need.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.770
It's hard to turn around inside.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.570
Just leave straight from there.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.170
Chief, take care on your way home.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:30.700
Okay.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:31.980
Drive safe.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:35.170
Go on.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:20.910
[Born with Luck]

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.890
[Episode 3]

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.540
Who changed the plan for tonight?

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:44.320
What's wrong?

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.280
It used to be inspections
in the downtown area.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.250
Now it's citywide checkpoints.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.120
All the police forces have been deployed.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.579
What are they trying to do?

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:56.960
Bring up the scene.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:00.760
[August 23, 2012]

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:01.750
[Smart Traffic Service Platform]
[Sanjiangkou Police Station]

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.530
Chief Zhang,

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:06.170
look for yourself.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.210
[Smart Traffic Service Platform]
[Sanjiangkou Police Station]

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.930
[Wenjing Road] [Sujiang Road]
[Sanjiang Road]

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.650
Whose idea was this?

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:19.810
Mine.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.390
It was my idea.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.750
I thought the previous plan

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.680
only targeted

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.220
key areas and roads.

00:03:27.079 --> 00:03:28.280
Drunk drivers

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.820
are drunk, not stupid.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.170
They can take a detour.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.560
The current plan

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.560
is a bit messy,

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.390
but the effect is quite obvious.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.480
Chief Zhang,

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:41.280
the previous plan

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.030
was based on our manpower.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:44.880
Your plan

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.090
is very good.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.329
But there is a problem now.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:52.960
Many people are stuck on the road

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.970
and can't go home.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.430
How do we solve it?

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:17.560
The answer is in the question.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:22.920
I got it.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.980
This is the effect Chief Zhang wants.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.560
Even if it causes

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.710
a day of hardship,

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:30.720
we must serve a warning

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.120
and deter drunk drivers.

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.840
This way, they won't dare to
risk it again.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.510
Captain Wang, what do you think?

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.020
I...

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:41.920
My opinion doesn't matter.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:42.850
You're the boss.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.110
As they say,

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.680
"Tears for your family,

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.080
and blood for yourself."

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.280
We must take this seriously.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:53.640
We might even find out

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.570
something else.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:08.560
Ninety.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.250
Ninety-one.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:11.770
Ninety-two.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:13.630
Ninety-three.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.600
Ninety-four.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.480
N-Ninety-five.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:20.600
N-Ninety-six.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:22.640
Ninety-seven.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.480
Ninety-eight.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.030
Ninety-nine.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:27.380
One hundred.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.580
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

00:05:58.950 --> 00:05:59.930
Drive safe!

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:07.210
♪ The breeze blows the willow tree tips ♪

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:16.560
Bro.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:17.310
Brake.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.650
Don't worry.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:24.390
Hey,

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:25.700
brake.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:30.240
Brake!

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:31.360
I can't brake!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.190
Brake, bro!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:19.800
Piece of junk.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:21.190
Selling us this scrapped car

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:22.270
for 25,000.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:24.880
It's practically a crime.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.210
What's wrong with a crime?

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.380
Committing crimes is our job.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.480
Others can look down on us.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:36.120
But we must never

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.510
look down on ourselves.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.130
Supply and demand dictate the price.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.190
In recent years, the police

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:12.390
have cracked down hard on illegal cars.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:14.360
It's hard now to bypass procedures

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.690
and buy an illegal car
with all the papers.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.730
This junk is only worth 5,000.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.000
The other 20,000 is for the documents.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.320
But this money must be spent.

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.090
Otherwise, if the police

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.120
find our car in the future

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.120
and track it down,

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:28.240
won't they discover

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.340
that we bought it?

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.429
We need to begin with the end in mind.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.120
Our main goal in coming to Sanjiangkou

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:34.870
is ultimately

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:36.330
to rob a corrupt official.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.150
We can't skimp on the necessary

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.750
preliminary preparations.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:42.510
Right now,

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:43.789
we're just counting on

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:46.110
robbing a big corrupt official
to break even.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:46.930
I thought

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.030
the gold we robbed

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:49.550
and that God of Wealth statue

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.510
would be worth at least

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.790
a million.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.970
That bastard Zheng

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.910
only gave us 80,000.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.670
He told us that right now,

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.530
stolen goods are hard to launder.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.670
Does gold need to be laundered?

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.850
Just melt it down and it's done!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.150
He'd better hope I don't run into him.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.010
If I do, I'll definitely kill him.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.000
The money he scammed from us

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:10.720
will return doubled

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.150
before long.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.720
After we rob the corrupt official,

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.200
everything other than cash

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.720
still needs to be
brought to Zheng to be liquidated.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.980
Then we'll take him out

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:21.710
and get our stuff back.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:23.360
This way, we get the money

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.760
and still have the stuff.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.170
Doesn't that double the value?

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.240
That makes sense.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.150
Then,

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.500
we'll find another collector next time,

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.570
and do exactly the same thing.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.550
We give him the stuff,

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.690
get the money,

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.840
then go back, take him out,

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.060
and get the stuff back.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.330
Doesn't that double it again?

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:49.840
Bro,

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.570
it'll be like we robbed
the corrupt official four times.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.970
Your math is excellent.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.380
No wonder you can't find a proper job.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.200
Why don't we just take out

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.120
that bastard who just sold us the car,

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.450
and be done with it, bro?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.480
You really are excellent.

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.520
Hey, man.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.150
Did I just give you 20,000

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.150
or 25,000?

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:24.120
No.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.050
Why do I still have 5,000 left here?

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.520
Okay, come and get it.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.150
We haven't gone far.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.670
Go past the first traffic light,

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:32.510
keep going,

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.090
and turn right at the fork.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:35.920
Okay, see you in a bit.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.010
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.130
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.220
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.420
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.930
This is a perfect place for murder.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:25.850
I'm here.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.710
Where are you?

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.200
Walk inside.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:50.850
By the river.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.240
Wait a minute.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:40.630
Murder!

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:41.670
Murder!

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:42.480
How does he know

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.480
about the murder?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:44.990
Murder!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.210
He sees the future?

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:02.910
Run!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:21.970
Chief Qi.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:23.510
Where is it?

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:24.170
Over there.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:34.550
Who's that?

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.000
A car dealer.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.320
You reported the case, right?

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.580
He's a used car dealer.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.480
Ye was killed last night.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.510
His transaction was scheduled

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:41.360
for this morning.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.080
The time doesn't add up.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.270
He shouldn't be the killer.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.390
You must investigate it thoroughly.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:45.120
Understood.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:46.980
Chen!

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:48.600
Chief Qi,

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:50.270
evidence collection is complete.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.270
You can come over.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.270
You guys carry on.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:19.960
Who has a cigarette?

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.290
Got a cigarette?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.050
Do any of you have a cigarette?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.510
Chief Qi, didn't you quit?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.040
I asked who has a cigarette!

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.170
I have some here.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:50.680
Bro.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.330
He has a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.330
You must have

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.170
experienced this too.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:12.630
He's a...

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.320
A straightforward person.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:15.720
Come.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:21.550
We might

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.260
not have become good friends,

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.660
but we should've been good partners.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.530
Don't take it to heart.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.720
He was like this to everyone.

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.240
Actually, he was the hardest on himself.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:36.840
He told me

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.070
many times to my face.

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:41.270
If he grew old

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.120
and had tubes going in and out of him,

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:43.870
lying in a hospital bed,

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.870
he wouldn't accept dying like that.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.510
For him, the most perfect way to die

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:48.050
would be

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.900
cracking the hardest case

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.440
in the world,

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.440
and catching

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.970
the most cunning criminal.

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.840
Then he would laugh out loud,

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.430
and pass away instantly.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.690
Passed away instantly.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.350
He shall grow not old,

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.320
as we that are left grow old.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.200
Age

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.260
shall not weary him.

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.560
At the going down of the sun
and in the morning,

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:27.990
we will remember him.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:35.280
Take him away.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:39.590
Gently.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:40.300
Gently.

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.050
Wait a moment.

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:54.410
Come.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:16:59.660
Yi'ang,

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.240
you're new,

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.030
but you are the deputy director

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:04.630
of the CID.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:06.890
You have to do everything you can,

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.530
search high and low,

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.970
to bring the killer to justice.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:12.920
I will do my best.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.250
Chief Qi.

00:17:22.349 --> 00:17:23.180
I found this

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.150
under Ye's body.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:27.520
What is it?

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.460
A name is written on it.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:31.440
A name?

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:33.550
It is highly likely that Ye left

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:34.310
the killer's name.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:34.910
What is it?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:36.550
[Yi'ang]

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:37.200
Your name.

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:45.620
[Yi'ang]

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:53.410
He...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.170
He didn't write Zhang Yi'ang.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:56.480
And right now,

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.240
we can't be sure

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.840
if this is Ye's handwriting.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.160
Chief Qi,

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.650
whether it's Ye's handwriting

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.820
still needs to be authenticated.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:06.490
Could the killer have written it

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:07.400
to frame you?

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:09.110
Chen,

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:12.130
what is Ye's estimated time of death?

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.110
Preliminary assessment

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.880
is that it was between
11 P.M. and midnight

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.350
last night.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.250
Where were you at this time?

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.930
Last night, Li Qian drove me

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.350
at 10:30 P.M.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:27.030
from work

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:27.900
to my home.

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:33.110
Chief, it's very convenient
to take a taxi.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.310
Why spend that money?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:35.160
You drive me home,

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.150
then take my car.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:37.290
Don't waste money.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.420
Save up when you can.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.170
That's correct.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:54.820
And then?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.020
Then I used my phone at home

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:00.720
to order takeout

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.380
from Wangzuo Malaban.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:03.920
It was delivered at 11:30 P.M.

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:05.520
I went to sleep after eating.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:07.730
Verify this.

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:08.560
Yes, sir.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:13.540
Don't rush.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.260
Make sure to figure

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.400
everything out.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:18.930
Yes, sir.

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:28.030
[Loyalty]

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.150
Why would my name be written?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.510
Even if Ye had an issue with me,

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.510
he shouldn't hold onto internal conflicts

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.680
at a time like this.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.210
It indeed doesn't make sense.

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:51.100
You just arrived in Sanjiangkou.

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:52.640
Speaking of internal conflicts,

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.170
you're the one benefiting,

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.720
so you have no motive for the crime.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.730
If you were the one lying there,

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.520
and wrote Captain Ye's name,

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.010
that would actually be quite logical.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.360
I...

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.350
I'm just speculating, hypothetically.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:12.880
No offense.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.070
None taken.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:15.720
I kind of wish

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.070
I was the one lying there,

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:17.830
and you all were here speculating

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.290
about what happened to me.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.390
Chief!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:23.480
What is it?

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:24.200
The person who delivered

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.200
your food yesterday has been found.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:27.160
Found?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:27.860
Yes.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.160
You really found them?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:29.750
Are you sure?

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:30.160
Yes.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:35.940
Thank you, Song.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:36.850
It's my job.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:37.790
I...

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.030
Thank you.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:39.200
[Police]

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:39.880
Good.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.030
Good. I'm glad it's found.

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:45.070
[Police]

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:45.870
I'm fine here.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.220
You can go back to work.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:48.540
I'll contact that person now

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.670
to come to the station for a statement.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:51.800
Thank you.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:55.570
Chief.

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.960
We found the witness
who delivered your meal.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.220
You're cleared of suspicion now, right?

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.180
Will we still look into

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:04.330
Captain Ye's case?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.820
Though I am in the clutch

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.160
of circumstance,

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.890
I thank whatever gods may be

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.040
for my unconquerable soul.

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:24.830
I understand.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:25.890
You mean

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.480
you want to investigate to the end.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.560
How did you

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:34.590
get that meaning?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.240
Weren't you just reciting

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:38.070
William Ernest Henley's poem?

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.310
I remember the next lines are:

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.640
Under the bludgeonings of chance,

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.920
my head is bloody, but unbowed.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.440
My body is battered,

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.640
my soul is bruised,

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:55.030
but I am unafraid.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:00.640
Those are the lines.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.210
Chief, let's analyze this.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:05.510
Captain Ye

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:08.590
didn't have this accident
at any other time.

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:09.550
He was murdered

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.390
right when you took office.

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:14.970
And you clearly came down here

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.790
with the task of investigating

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:17.720
Chief Lu's case.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:19.720
Is it possible

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:23.170
that Captain Ye's murder

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:25.590
is connected to Chief Lu's case?

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.160
That's a very bold analysis.

00:22:33.510 --> 00:22:34.270
But I suggest

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:36.210
we shouldn't be so bold right now.

00:22:37.030 --> 00:22:37.510
Chief,

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:38.960
we need to go through

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:39.880
all the criminal cases handled

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:40.920
in the year before Chief Lu died,

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:41.690
one by one,

00:22:42.030 --> 00:22:43.350
to see if there are any clues.

00:22:43.350 --> 00:22:44.350
What do you think?

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:45.440
I think...

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:47.480
we can.

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:48.480
We can take a look.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:50.550
It's just that I have a lot

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:51.160
on my plate right now.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:53.160
Don't worry about it. I'll go check.

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:56.010
Thank you for your efforts.

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:01.300
At such a young age,

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:03.120
why do you read so much poetry?

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:09.070
[Reason for borrowing: case investigation]
[Name: Ye Jian]

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:17.550
[Criminal Investigation File]

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:22.060
All filled out?

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:25.760
Captain Ye

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.200
also came to review files yesterday?

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:27.510
Yes.

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.480
What kind of cases were they?

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:31.720
Cases Chief Lu was involved in

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:33.030
the year before he passed away.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:34.360
They're all right here.

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:35.690
Thanks.

00:23:39.550 --> 00:23:40.300
Li Qian.

00:23:41.790 --> 00:23:42.890
I was looking for you.

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:44.220
What's wrong, Chief Qi?

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:48.680
Yi'ang,

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:49.960
come, have a seat.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:02.880
The trace inspection results are out.

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:04.550
The small stone used for writing

00:24:04.550 --> 00:24:05.680
only had

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.680
Ye's blood and fingerprints on it.

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:08.310
Around the body,

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:10.270
there were no biological traces
of anyone else.

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:10.720
So,

00:24:11.830 --> 00:24:12.670
your name

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.480
could only have been written by Ye himself

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:16.680
right before he died.

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:21.970
There's another thing.

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:23.420
Why did you

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:25.550
order food from Wangzuo Malaban?

00:24:25.550 --> 00:24:26.280
That place is

00:24:26.350 --> 00:24:27.750
seven or eight kilometers away

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:28.880
from where you live.

00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:31.020
It tastes good.

00:24:31.590 --> 00:24:32.910
Well... what's wrong?

00:24:33.350 --> 00:24:34.080
Chief Zhang,

00:24:34.480 --> 00:24:36.270
the woman who delivered your food,

00:24:36.270 --> 00:24:36.960
Jiang Ying,

00:24:38.030 --> 00:24:39.030
has gone missing.

00:24:39.880 --> 00:24:40.640
Missing?

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:43.920
After the police went to the restaurant

00:24:43.920 --> 00:24:45.250
and confirmed with her,

00:24:45.720 --> 00:24:46.720
I wanted her to come to the bureau

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:48.400
so we could ask a few questions.

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:49.800
But when I called her,

00:24:50.270 --> 00:24:52.130
her phone was already turned off.

00:24:53.750 --> 00:24:54.350
Missing?

00:25:03.240 --> 00:25:03.760
What,

00:25:03.930 --> 00:25:05.400
are you suspecting that I

00:25:05.510 --> 00:25:06.570
arranged for...

00:25:07.310 --> 00:25:08.170
a fake witness?

00:25:23.920 --> 00:25:24.980
Some comrades here

00:25:26.350 --> 00:25:28.000
might have some feelings against me,

00:25:28.000 --> 00:25:28.590
or even

00:25:29.200 --> 00:25:30.310
be unwilling to cooperate with my work.

00:25:30.310 --> 00:25:31.570
I can understand that.

00:25:31.830 --> 00:25:32.590
But everything

00:25:32.590 --> 00:25:34.120
has its limits, doesn't it?

00:25:34.200 --> 00:25:35.390
If someone is

00:25:35.790 --> 00:25:38.320
intentionally spreading rumors
to frame me,

00:25:39.680 --> 00:25:40.940
I cannot forgive that.

00:25:42.480 --> 00:25:44.280
What really makes us suspicious

00:25:45.270 --> 00:25:46.270
is her testimony.

00:25:55.260 --> 00:25:55.880
Li Qian.

00:26:07.070 --> 00:26:07.800
Chief Zhang,

00:26:08.640 --> 00:26:09.690
last night,

00:26:10.310 --> 00:26:11.310
I only dropped you off

00:26:11.310 --> 00:26:13.370
at the intersection near your house.

00:26:14.350 --> 00:26:16.480
Whether you actually went home or not,

00:26:17.120 --> 00:26:17.600
I...

00:26:19.400 --> 00:26:20.400
truly don't know.

00:26:43.740 --> 00:26:44.470
Chief Zhang.

00:26:45.550 --> 00:26:46.280
Chief Zhang.

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:49.510
After that,

00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:50.920
you gave Ye a call,

00:26:50.960 --> 00:26:51.470
right?

00:26:52.310 --> 00:26:52.640
Yes,

00:26:52.720 --> 00:26:53.850
I did call him.

00:26:53.880 --> 00:26:55.120
Can I see your phone?

00:27:12.200 --> 00:27:13.010
At the time, why didn't you mention

00:27:13.010 --> 00:27:13.640
[Call Record] [Ye Jian]

00:27:13.640 --> 00:27:14.670
this detail?

00:27:21.240 --> 00:27:22.000
I forgot.

00:27:22.510 --> 00:27:23.710
I really just forgot.

00:27:24.160 --> 00:27:25.750
I made that call to Ye

00:27:27.270 --> 00:27:28.070
to have a talk with him.

00:27:28.070 --> 00:27:29.000
Talk about what?

00:27:30.550 --> 00:27:31.680
I just wanted to talk.

00:27:31.680 --> 00:27:32.700
Between us,

00:27:34.440 --> 00:27:35.990
there's no real conflict.

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:37.030
We still have to

00:27:37.030 --> 00:27:38.350
work together in the future.

00:27:38.350 --> 00:27:39.790
I wanted to treat him to a meal.

00:27:39.790 --> 00:27:40.810
Treat him to a meal

00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:41.930
or have a talk?

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:49.060
Chief Qi, what does this mean?

00:27:50.550 --> 00:27:52.400
Everyone just wants to understand

00:27:52.400 --> 00:27:54.000
the situation more clearly.

00:28:04.110 --> 00:28:04.640
Yi'ang,

00:28:04.830 --> 00:28:05.720
where are you going?

00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:06.400
I don't think you should

00:28:06.400 --> 00:28:07.590
get involved in this case, okay?

00:28:07.590 --> 00:28:09.650
I'll definitely stay out of the case.

00:28:10.070 --> 00:28:11.440
I need to find that delivery worker.

00:28:11.440 --> 00:28:12.640
Right now, only she can prove

00:28:12.640 --> 00:28:13.700
that I'm innocent.

00:28:15.550 --> 00:28:16.280
Is that okay?

00:28:18.350 --> 00:28:19.720
Don't just stand there.

00:28:19.790 --> 00:28:20.690
Go help look.

00:28:33.310 --> 00:28:34.720
[Police]

00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:35.250
Chief.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:36.960
Chief.

00:28:38.070 --> 00:28:38.730
Let me do it.

00:28:39.440 --> 00:28:40.000
Chief.

00:28:53.120 --> 00:28:53.740
Chief.

00:29:10.880 --> 00:29:11.490
Chief,

00:29:11.550 --> 00:29:12.810
where are we going now?

00:29:37.400 --> 00:29:39.050
Sorry, Song Xing.

00:29:39.440 --> 00:29:41.240
Chief, what's wrong?

00:29:42.480 --> 00:29:43.400
I shouldn't have said that

00:29:43.400 --> 00:29:44.800
to you upstairs just now.

00:29:45.550 --> 00:29:47.150
You don't need to apologize.

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:47.880
You don't need to apologize

00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:49.680
no matter how you scold or hit me.

00:29:49.830 --> 00:29:51.040
As police,

00:29:51.350 --> 00:29:51.880
we should

00:29:51.880 --> 00:29:53.480
doubt the doubt of the doubt.

00:29:54.240 --> 00:29:55.450
I said that myself.

00:29:56.110 --> 00:29:57.070
You are right

00:29:58.030 --> 00:29:58.830
to suspect me.

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:25.900
Chief.

00:30:28.480 --> 00:30:30.060
Since I became a policeman,

00:30:31.590 --> 00:30:32.720
in every meeting,

00:30:33.200 --> 00:30:34.380
I have been thinking actively

00:30:34.380 --> 00:30:35.440
and eager to speak.

00:30:35.960 --> 00:30:38.270
I've made at least
hundreds of suggestions.

00:30:38.270 --> 00:30:39.350
But Captain Ye and the others

00:30:39.350 --> 00:30:40.810
have never accepted them.

00:30:42.790 --> 00:30:43.920
At the very beginning,

00:30:43.920 --> 00:30:45.250
they still let me speak.

00:30:45.750 --> 00:30:46.350
Now,

00:30:46.350 --> 00:30:48.350
they don't even let me talk in meetings.

00:30:48.350 --> 00:30:48.880
I have no idea

00:30:48.880 --> 00:30:50.410
why they treat me like this.

00:30:51.200 --> 00:30:51.910
But you,

00:30:52.270 --> 00:30:53.330
you're different.

00:30:54.160 --> 00:30:55.590
About the joint DUI operation,

00:30:55.590 --> 00:30:56.310
I just went to you

00:30:56.310 --> 00:30:57.160
with the mindset of

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:58.020
giving it a try.

00:30:58.400 --> 00:30:59.960
I didn't expect you to accept it

00:30:59.960 --> 00:31:01.560
without me even explaining.

00:31:02.920 --> 00:31:03.350
Later,

00:31:03.350 --> 00:31:04.920
when such a big thing happened,

00:31:04.920 --> 00:31:06.310
you still said I was right

00:31:06.310 --> 00:31:07.510
and that I helped you.

00:31:08.720 --> 00:31:09.980
What is appreciation?

00:31:10.350 --> 00:31:11.610
This is appreciation.

00:31:13.790 --> 00:31:14.380
Chief,

00:31:15.030 --> 00:31:16.360
when you said that,

00:31:16.480 --> 00:31:17.410
I made up my mind.

00:31:17.790 --> 00:31:19.990
I will follow you for the rest of my life.

00:31:29.990 --> 00:31:30.500
Xing,

00:31:31.440 --> 00:31:32.210
in my life,

00:31:32.630 --> 00:31:34.960
I have basically never misjudged anyone.

00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:51.060
Chief,

00:31:51.150 --> 00:31:52.420
when Chief Qi asked me,

00:31:52.480 --> 00:31:54.280
of course I had to tell the truth.

00:31:54.920 --> 00:31:56.200
I did only drop you off

00:31:56.240 --> 00:31:57.900
at the intersection that day.

00:31:58.800 --> 00:31:59.930
But for this matter,

00:32:00.750 --> 00:32:01.830
you just need to prove that

00:32:01.830 --> 00:32:02.640
it was impossible

00:32:02.640 --> 00:32:04.240
for you to be at the scene then.

00:32:04.240 --> 00:32:05.310
Then it'll be over.

00:32:07.270 --> 00:32:08.870
You are a veteran detective.

00:32:09.440 --> 00:32:11.310
So smart and experienced.

00:32:12.310 --> 00:32:13.070
For you,

00:32:13.070 --> 00:32:15.030
this must be very easy.

00:32:16.270 --> 00:32:16.880
I am not

00:32:16.880 --> 00:32:17.910
a show-off.

00:32:18.830 --> 00:32:19.700
Coming to Sanjiangkou,

00:32:19.700 --> 00:32:21.360
I should keep a lower profile.

00:32:21.830 --> 00:32:22.830
Now you are forcing me

00:32:22.830 --> 00:32:24.230
to rush to the front line.

00:32:24.880 --> 00:32:25.810
What should I do?

00:32:25.960 --> 00:32:27.270
Show off my skills to our comrades?

00:32:27.270 --> 00:32:28.590
-Just show us.
-Just show us.

00:32:28.590 --> 00:32:29.920
We really want to see it.

00:32:30.400 --> 00:32:31.550
Xing, stop driving in circles.

00:32:31.550 --> 00:32:32.750
I'm a little carsick.

00:32:34.200 --> 00:32:34.770
No,

00:32:35.070 --> 00:32:35.530
Chief.

00:32:35.560 --> 00:32:36.750
It's not that I'm driving in circles.

00:32:36.750 --> 00:32:37.310
You haven't told me

00:32:37.310 --> 00:32:38.370
where we are going.

00:32:39.480 --> 00:32:40.540
Where are we going?

00:32:40.590 --> 00:32:42.590
Wait a minute. I'm a little carsick.

00:32:42.590 --> 00:32:42.960
Okay.

00:32:49.220 --> 00:32:50.460
We found Jiang Ying's address.

00:32:50.460 --> 00:32:51.290
Follow me.

00:32:58.790 --> 00:32:59.270
Sir,

00:32:59.290 --> 00:33:00.750
what are you doing? Open the door.

00:33:00.750 --> 00:33:01.590
Going out?

00:33:01.750 --> 00:33:02.750
What do you think?

00:33:07.480 --> 00:33:08.210
This gate...

00:33:18.550 --> 00:33:18.750
[Yingzi General Store]

00:33:18.750 --> 00:33:19.640
Police!

00:33:19.790 --> 00:33:20.720
Is anyone there?

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:25.600
How's the situation?

00:33:26.110 --> 00:33:26.510
Chief.

00:33:27.240 --> 00:33:29.300
I don't think there's anyone inside.

00:33:31.310 --> 00:33:32.310
Did you call them?

00:33:32.470 --> 00:33:34.330
Both their phones are turned off.

00:33:34.400 --> 00:33:36.260
Both their phones are turned off.

00:33:38.160 --> 00:33:38.830
Should we

00:33:38.830 --> 00:33:40.160
break the door open now?

00:33:41.680 --> 00:33:44.080
Chief Zhang is going to
break the door open.

00:33:49.550 --> 00:33:50.510
That's against protocol.

00:33:50.510 --> 00:33:51.480
They aren't criminals.

00:33:51.480 --> 00:33:52.640
We don't have a warrant.

00:33:52.640 --> 00:33:53.480
On what grounds can we break in?

00:33:53.480 --> 00:33:54.640
Who will take the blame
if something happens?

00:33:54.640 --> 00:33:55.310
Chief Qi said...

00:33:55.310 --> 00:33:56.770
I heard him. I heard it all.

00:34:01.000 --> 00:34:01.650
Look.

00:34:02.200 --> 00:34:03.160
When Captain Ye had his accident,

00:34:03.160 --> 00:34:04.270
this woman delivered food to me.

00:34:04.270 --> 00:34:04.670
Right?

00:34:04.720 --> 00:34:05.880
Now both of them have run away.

00:34:05.880 --> 00:34:06.790
Don't you find that suspicious?

00:34:06.790 --> 00:34:07.520
Suspicious.

00:34:07.830 --> 00:34:08.960
So do you agree to break in?

00:34:08.960 --> 00:34:09.800
I agree it's suspicious.

00:34:09.800 --> 00:34:10.920
But we need a warrant to force the door.

00:34:10.920 --> 00:34:11.840
With no warrant and no evidence,

00:34:11.840 --> 00:34:12.900
how can we break in?

00:34:13.480 --> 00:34:14.150
The evidence is inside.

00:34:14.150 --> 00:34:14.670
If I don't break in,

00:34:14.670 --> 00:34:15.400
how can I get the evidence?

00:34:15.400 --> 00:34:17.400
We can't break in without evidence.

00:34:20.370 --> 00:34:26.870
[Yingzi General Store]

00:34:41.880 --> 00:34:43.540
Chief Zhang has no solutions.

00:34:43.590 --> 00:34:44.510
He's helpless.

00:34:58.630 --> 00:34:59.330
I know

00:34:59.360 --> 00:35:00.320
I will be neglected

00:35:00.320 --> 00:35:01.850
in some corner of the world.

00:35:03.280 --> 00:35:03.960
The last remaining

00:35:03.960 --> 00:35:05.310
glimmer of light,

00:35:05.920 --> 00:35:07.260
at the end of life,

00:35:07.630 --> 00:35:08.680
will flicker

00:35:10.590 --> 00:35:11.790
and be extinguished.

00:35:13.070 --> 00:35:13.710
It's time

00:35:13.760 --> 00:35:15.890
for Chief Zhang's poetry recitation.

00:35:15.960 --> 00:35:16.820
Extinguished.

00:35:21.320 --> 00:35:22.050
Chief Zhang!

00:35:25.000 --> 00:35:25.730
Chief Zhang!

00:35:28.840 --> 00:35:30.040
This is the landlord.

00:35:31.360 --> 00:35:31.760
Hello.

00:35:31.760 --> 00:35:32.160
Hello.

00:35:32.550 --> 00:35:33.100
Ma'am,

00:35:33.670 --> 00:35:34.630
Jiang Ying, who lives here,

00:35:34.630 --> 00:35:35.590
is an important witness.

00:35:35.590 --> 00:35:36.480
Do you agree to let us

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:38.630
to break the door open and investigate?

00:35:38.630 --> 00:35:39.410
No.

00:35:40.550 --> 00:35:42.010
Why do you need to break in?

00:35:44.030 --> 00:35:45.400
I have a key.

00:35:46.360 --> 00:35:47.360
Thank you, ma'am.

00:35:47.400 --> 00:35:48.670
Come on, turn on the body cams.

00:35:48.670 --> 00:35:49.110
Hurry up.

00:35:49.110 --> 00:35:49.710
Turn it on.

00:35:51.210 --> 00:35:54.780
[Police]

00:36:12.920 --> 00:36:14.030
Who is the person

00:36:14.070 --> 00:36:15.030
living with Jiang Ying?

00:36:15.030 --> 00:36:16.480
It's Jiang Ying's husband.

00:36:16.480 --> 00:36:17.880
I think his surname is Li.

00:36:18.000 --> 00:36:18.510
When they left,

00:36:18.510 --> 00:36:19.510
did they tell you?

00:36:19.710 --> 00:36:21.110
They didn't say anything.

00:36:21.110 --> 00:36:22.970
What could that couple have done?

00:36:23.440 --> 00:36:25.480
That man wouldn't even
dare to kill a chicken.

00:36:25.480 --> 00:36:26.670
The bedroom's in there?

00:36:26.670 --> 00:36:27.000
Yes.

00:36:47.030 --> 00:36:47.760
Chief Zhang.

00:36:50.000 --> 00:36:50.930
Hold this for me.

00:37:23.110 --> 00:37:24.440
The woman's height is between 1.60

00:37:24.440 --> 00:37:25.600
and 1.62 meters.

00:37:26.110 --> 00:37:27.590
She has a well-proportioned figure,

00:37:27.590 --> 00:37:29.450
weighs no more than 50 kilograms,

00:37:29.550 --> 00:37:30.680
and dresses neatly.

00:37:38.630 --> 00:37:39.500
She has fair skin

00:37:39.500 --> 00:37:40.720
and chestnut hair.

00:37:42.670 --> 00:37:43.760
Her footsteps?

00:37:43.780 --> 00:37:45.060
Light and fast.

00:37:48.340 --> 00:37:50.140
She speaks clearly and briskly.

00:37:50.440 --> 00:37:51.600
What about the man?

00:37:52.280 --> 00:37:53.210
I don't know about the man.

00:37:53.210 --> 00:37:54.940
How do you know about the woman?

00:37:55.070 --> 00:37:56.440
The woman delivered food to me.

00:37:56.440 --> 00:37:57.240
I've seen her.

00:37:59.070 --> 00:37:59.830
Here.

00:37:59.960 --> 00:38:01.150
Notify everyone immediately.

00:38:01.150 --> 00:38:02.550
Mobilize all police forces

00:38:02.550 --> 00:38:04.150
from surrounding towns
and police stations.

00:38:04.150 --> 00:38:06.070
Secure the bus and train stations,

00:38:06.070 --> 00:38:06.710
and all major entrances

00:38:06.710 --> 00:38:07.960
and exits of the city.

00:38:08.400 --> 00:38:09.670
Launch a citywide manhunt immediately.

00:38:09.670 --> 00:38:10.420
Tonight,

00:38:10.510 --> 00:38:11.190
we must catch them

00:38:11.190 --> 00:38:12.430
in Sanjiangkou.

00:38:12.490 --> 00:38:17.380
[Sanjiangkou Transportation Center]

00:38:30.550 --> 00:38:36.190
[Please keep one meter away]

00:38:56.250 --> 00:38:56.710
[Please keep one meter away]

00:38:57.050 --> 00:38:57.230
Let's go.

00:38:57.230 --> 00:38:58.320
[Please keep one meter away]

00:38:58.320 --> 00:39:00.320
A guy over there keeps looking at me.

00:39:00.510 --> 00:39:01.510
Could he be a cop?